{"id":"n60706-1-7","stage":4,"title":"비염 · 鼻炎","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60706-1-7-1","ko":"가을이 되면서 자꾸 재채기를 하고 콧물이 많이 나와요.","zh":"进入秋天后，我总是打喷嚏，流鼻涕也很严重。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가을이","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되면서","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재채기를","meaning":"打喷嚏","explanation":"재채기：打喷嚏；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"재채기","audio":"/audio/89fa9bcbed0e9260d5e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24966","senseId":"1","lemma":"재채기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做、发出这一动作（재채기를 하다：打喷嚏）","explanation":"하다：做、发出这一动作（재채기를 하다：打喷嚏）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"콧물이","meaning":"鼻涕，鼻水","explanation":"콧물：鼻涕，鼻水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"콧물","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81350","senseId":"1","lemma":"콧물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나와요.","meaning":"流出，漏出，涌出","explanation":"나오다：流出，漏出，涌出；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"9","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c5911194be78d7d5","term":"가을","zh":"秋天，秋季","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3","entryId":"32204","definition":"四季中的一个，介于夏天和冬天之间的季节。","pronunciation":["가을"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"89fa9bcbed0e9260","term":"재채기","zh":"打喷嚏","audio":"/audio/89fa9bcbed0e9260d5e5.mp3","entryId":"24966","definition":"鼻子里受到刺激，急剧吸气，然后很快由鼻孔喷出并发出声音的现象。","pronunciation":["재채기"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、发出这一动作（재채기를 하다：打喷嚏）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、发出这一动作（재채기를 하다：打喷嚏）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8ba5845818eda881","term":"콧물","zh":"鼻涕，鼻水","audio":"/audio/8ba5845818eda8819b8a.mp3","entryId":"81350","definition":"从鼻孔里流出来的粘粘糊糊的液体。","pronunciation":["콘물"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"流出，漏出，涌出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"液体或气体等从里面流到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/17dd014e85e9a4e001a7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60706-1-7-2","ko":"알레르기성 비염이니 약을 먹어야겠군요.","zh":"这是过敏性鼻炎，得吃药治疗了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알레르기성","meaning":"过敏","explanation":"알레르기：过敏；성：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"알레르기","audio":"/audio/27c6eb71a8eb67f063fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66765","senseId":"1","lemma":"알레르기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비염이니","meaning":"鼻炎","explanation":"비염：鼻炎；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"비염","audio":"/audio/06062da99472ec3c0895.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60706","senseId":"1","lemma":"비염","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹어야겠군요.","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"27c6eb71a8eb67f0","term":"알레르기","zh":"过敏","audio":"/audio/27c6eb71a8eb67f063fe.mp3","entryId":"66765","definition":"某物质触碰身体或进入体内时身体对此产生反应，而出现不舒服或痛的症状。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"06062da99472ec3c","term":"비염","zh":"鼻炎","audio":"/audio/06062da99472ec3c0895.mp3","entryId":"60706","definition":"鼻子内发生炎症致使不通或流鼻涕、打喷嚏等症状的疾病。","pronunciation":["비ː염"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5111021d07a8b9b1d13.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.025,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60706","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":144,"sequenceScore":2.8517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["进入秋天后，我总是打喷嚏，流鼻涕也很严重。","这是过敏性鼻炎，得吃药治疗了。","爸爸，我们也去城里住吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["进入秋天后，我总是打喷嚏，流鼻涕也很严重。","这是过敏性鼻炎，得吃药治疗了。","爸爸，我们也去城里住吧。"],"answer":1}]}
